WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.100
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.370 --> 01:34.940
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.360 --> 01:37.780
[Episode 55]

4
01:38.009 --> 01:45.860
[Wayaobu, Shaanxi; Encampment of the 3rd Bureau of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission]

5
01:44.870 --> 01:46.400
The sending method isn't wrong.

6
01:46.400 --> 01:47.860
It's the 4th Front Red Army

7
01:47.920 --> 01:49.630
sending a telegram to the 2nd and the 6th Red Army Corps.

8
01:49.630 --> 01:51.110
Then why did it suddenly stop?

9
01:50.979 --> 01:56.190
[Wang Zheng, Director of the Third Bureau of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission]

10
01:51.210 --> 01:53.470
The 4th Front Army just sent a short code.

11
01:53.560 --> 01:54.789
The battery is dead.

12
01:55.310 --> 01:57.070
They need to pause for ten minutes.

13
01:57.070 --> 01:57.789
Li.

14
01:58.000 --> 01:59.940
Hurry. Go report to Vice Chairman Zhou.

15
01:59.940 --> 02:00.740
Yes!

16
02:07.080 --> 02:12.870
[Temporary Encampment of the Red 2nd and 6th Army Corps, Shiqian, Guizhou]

17
02:07.870 --> 02:09.530
Report. There's a situation.

18
02:12.630 --> 02:13.540
What's wrong?

19
02:14.400 --> 02:16.600
Someone is contacting us in plain code.

20
02:18.430 --> 02:19.630
Is it the 4th Front Army?

21
02:19.630 --> 02:20.430
No.

22
02:20.730 --> 02:22.760
His sending method is different from before.

23
02:22.760 --> 02:23.630
Ask him where he's from.

24
02:23.630 --> 02:24.190
Yes.

25
02:30.870 --> 02:33.100
This is Detachment Commander Wang Zheng.

26
02:33.100 --> 02:35.160
I am ordered to contact your station.

27
02:35.340 --> 02:37.740
Please ask Commander Yan to get on the line.

28
02:37.800 --> 02:39.950
I have something important to discuss.

29
02:39.950 --> 02:41.110
Comrade Wang Zheng.

30
02:43.079 --> 02:43.750
Vice Chairman Zhou.

31
02:43.750 --> 02:44.710
How is the situation?

32
02:44.710 --> 02:45.940
I am using plain code

33
02:45.960 --> 02:47.760
to contact the 2nd and 6th Corps.

34
02:48.000 --> 02:48.590
Great.

35
02:48.630 --> 02:49.490
Quick, continue.

36
02:49.490 --> 02:50.120
Okay.

37
02:50.560 --> 02:51.690
Vice Chairman Zhou.

38
02:55.110 --> 02:56.220
He says he is Detachment Commander Wang Zheng

39
02:56.220 --> 02:58.000
and needs Commander Yan to get on the line.

40
02:58.000 --> 02:58.960
Commander Yan.

41
02:59.030 --> 02:59.870
Coming.

42
03:02.050 --> 03:03.870
The other side claims to be Wang Zheng.

43
03:03.870 --> 03:05.930
We need to verify his identity first.

44
03:10.620 --> 03:13.650
[Yan Zhifei, Commander of the Radio Detachment of the Red 2nd and 6th Army Corps]

45
03:19.800 --> 03:21.500
It is indeed Comrade Wang Zheng.

46
03:21.500 --> 03:23.070
I am very familiar with his sending method,

47
03:23.070 --> 03:24.590
and the information checks out.

48
03:24.590 --> 03:25.590
Ask him what instructions the Military Commission has.

49
03:25.590 --> 03:26.590
I will go report to the leader immediately.

50
03:26.590 --> 03:27.360
Okay.

51
03:34.800 --> 03:35.960
Identity verified.

52
03:36.120 --> 03:37.920
It is indeed Comrade Yan Zhifei.

53
03:38.000 --> 03:39.000
He asks the Military Commission

54
03:39.000 --> 03:40.800
what the next instructions are.

55
03:43.350 --> 03:44.510
Reply to them.

56
03:46.160 --> 03:47.200
"Bi.

57
03:47.590 --> 03:49.650
We have arrived in northern Shaanxi.

58
03:50.280 --> 03:52.570
The code is left with the 4th.

59
03:53.630 --> 03:55.460
Hao."

60
03:56.630 --> 03:57.590
How is it?

61
03:57.800 --> 03:58.630
Leader.

62
03:58.630 --> 04:01.890
This is the plain code telegram sent by Comrade Wang Zheng.

63
04:04.910 --> 04:06.030
"Bi.

64
04:06.280 --> 04:08.180
We have arrived in northern Shaanxi.

65
04:08.180 --> 04:09.860
The code is left with the 4th."

66
04:11.190 --> 04:14.360
The signature reads, "Hao."

67
04:13.900 --> 04:15.630
[He Long, Corps Commander of the 2nd Red Army Corps]

68
04:15.240 --> 04:16.269
Hao?

69
04:17.070 --> 04:18.160
Wu Hao.

70
04:18.019 --> 04:21.329
[Ren Bishi, Member of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee; Political Commissar of the 2nd Red Army Corps]

71
04:18.209 --> 04:18.959
Comrade Zhou Enlai

72
04:18.959 --> 04:21.510
used the alias Wu Hao when working in Shanghai.

73
04:21.510 --> 04:24.370
We've contacted each other under this name before.

74
04:24.450 --> 04:25.620
[Guan Xiangying, Deputy Political Commissar of the 2nd Red Army Corps]

75
04:25.120 --> 04:27.830
Given that the Central Committee has arrived in northern Shaanxi

76
04:27.830 --> 04:30.490
yet they are sending us telegrams in plain code,

77
04:30.750 --> 04:34.090
then what is going on with Zhu and Zhang,

78
04:34.490 --> 04:35.950
who have been in contact with us all this time?

79
04:35.950 --> 04:38.220
Could it be that the Central Committee and the Military Commission

80
04:38.220 --> 04:40.260
have a problem with communication?

81
04:40.290 --> 04:42.250
We have asked the Military Commission many times before

82
04:42.250 --> 04:43.580
about the situation of the Central Committee,

83
04:43.580 --> 04:46.260
but they never gave a clear reply.

84
04:47.870 --> 04:48.750
Ren.

85
04:49.270 --> 04:50.750
Should we ask?

86
04:53.950 --> 04:57.390
Since the telegram emphasizes that the code is left with the 4th,

87
04:57.390 --> 04:59.750
it means the Central Committee doesn't have the code,

88
04:59.750 --> 05:03.270
and there are details that are inconvenient to say clearly.

89
05:04.000 --> 05:05.240
Besides, plain code communication

90
05:05.240 --> 05:07.240
is easily intercepted by the enemy.

91
05:10.320 --> 05:11.880
What we can be sure of now is

92
05:12.000 --> 05:13.950
that the Central Committee has arrived in northern Shaanxi.

93
05:13.950 --> 05:15.680
As for the specific situation,

94
05:15.800 --> 05:18.600
we can ask Zhu and Zhang when we have a chance later.

95
05:19.160 --> 05:19.750
Okay.

96
05:22.360 --> 05:24.090
The other side hasn't replied.

97
05:27.240 --> 05:28.720
It's open-code communication.

98
05:28.720 --> 05:30.600
It's right not to reply further.

99
05:30.890 --> 05:32.930
We mainly wanted to inform them

100
05:33.630 --> 05:34.830
of the location of our Central Committee.

101
05:34.830 --> 05:37.030
Our purpose has already been achieved.

102
05:41.210 --> 05:44.690
[Luochuan Airport, Shaanxi]

103
05:49.920 --> 05:51.040
Deputy Commander-in-Chief, watch your step.

104
05:51.040 --> 05:52.120
Where is Gao Fuyuan?

105
05:52.120 --> 05:53.940
I caught him in Ganquan and brought him back.

106
05:53.940 --> 05:55.520
He is now at my army headquarters.

107
05:55.520 --> 05:57.800
The fewer people know about this, the better.

108
05:57.800 --> 05:58.920
Don't worry.

109
06:07.080 --> 06:07.720
Let's go.

110
06:13.050 --> 06:17.700
[No.67 Army Headquarters of the Northeastern Army]

111
06:14.350 --> 06:15.310
Pass down the order.

112
06:15.310 --> 06:16.430
Without my command,

113
06:16.430 --> 06:17.270
no one is allowed to enter!

114
06:17.270 --> 06:18.120
Yes!

115
06:20.690 --> 06:22.350
Deputy Commander-in-Chief!

116
06:24.450 --> 06:26.060
Gao Fuyuan, right?

117
06:27.040 --> 06:27.620
Yes.

118
06:32.650 --> 06:33.450
You're back?

119
06:34.070 --> 06:35.040
Yes.

120
06:37.610 --> 06:39.570
Did he walk back,

121
06:39.600 --> 06:41.360
or crawl back?

122
06:43.620 --> 06:44.480
I was sent back.

123
06:46.230 --> 06:48.190
[Gao Fuyuan, former Commander of the 619th Regiment of the 107th Division, 67th Army of the Northeastern Army]

124
06:48.190 --> 06:52.300
[Zhang Xueliang, Acting Commander-in-Chief of the Northwest Communist Suppression General Headquarters of the Kuomintang Army]

125
06:54.720 --> 06:56.480
Gao Fuyuan.

126
06:56.750 --> 07:00.140
You graduated from the 5th class of the Northeast Military Academy.

127
07:00.140 --> 07:03.230
You had excellent grades during training

128
07:03.550 --> 07:05.280
and performed outstandingly.

129
07:05.600 --> 07:06.720
After graduation,

130
07:06.800 --> 07:10.680
you served as the Company Commander and Battalion Commander of my guards.

131
07:08.280 --> 07:11.770
[Wang Yizhe, Commander of the 67th Army of the Northeastern Army]

132
07:10.870 --> 07:12.190
In 1927,

133
07:12.310 --> 07:14.850
when the Northeast Model Student Corps was established,

134
07:14.850 --> 07:20.330
you served as the Lieutenant Colonel Director of the Education Department.

135
07:20.360 --> 07:21.410
Right?

136
07:22.440 --> 07:23.080
Yes!

137
07:24.750 --> 07:26.380
Since then,

138
07:27.510 --> 07:29.160
on your forehead,

139
07:30.120 --> 07:31.750
some words were written,

140
07:32.110 --> 07:34.190
which everyone could see clearly:

141
07:34.340 --> 07:37.300
Xueliang's confidant.

142
07:37.510 --> 07:39.260
I will never forget

143
07:40.270 --> 07:42.659
the Deputy Commander-in-Chief's support.

144
07:42.659 --> 07:43.900
You forgot!

145
07:44.110 --> 07:46.060
You forgot completely!

146
07:46.870 --> 07:49.159
What is written on his forehead now?

147
07:49.630 --> 07:51.430
Communist-colluding traitor!

148
07:52.810 --> 07:54.470
Deputy Commander-in-Chief.

149
07:55.159 --> 07:56.920
I accept whatever you say.

150
07:57.220 --> 07:58.390
But today,

151
07:58.620 --> 08:00.310
I’m not here to talk you into anything.

152
08:00.310 --> 08:01.800
I am here to persuade you

153
08:02.610 --> 08:04.320
to stop fighting the Red Army

154
08:04.470 --> 08:06.380
and unite with them to resist Japan together.

155
08:06.380 --> 08:07.550
You lost the battle,

156
08:07.570 --> 08:08.920
became a captive,

157
08:09.120 --> 08:11.240
and still have the nerve to come back and persuade me?

158
08:11.240 --> 08:12.120
Guards!

159
08:12.190 --> 08:13.120
Here!

160
08:13.140 --> 08:14.430
Drag him out and shoot him!

161
08:14.430 --> 08:15.190
Deputy Commander-in-Chief.

162
08:15.190 --> 08:15.950
I am burning with passion

163
08:15.950 --> 08:17.430
and have a lot to say to you!

164
08:17.480 --> 08:18.720
You won't let me say half a word!

165
08:18.720 --> 08:20.580
I didn't expect you to be so narrow-minded!

166
08:20.580 --> 08:21.910
I refuse to accept this!

167
08:22.070 --> 08:22.700
Wait!

168
08:24.580 --> 08:25.680
Deputy Commander-in-Chief.

169
08:25.680 --> 08:27.230
Gao Fuyuan has been with you

170
08:27.260 --> 08:28.670
for over 10 years.

171
08:29.120 --> 08:30.520
Whatever he wants to say,

172
08:30.560 --> 08:31.960
you might as well listen.

173
08:35.390 --> 08:36.429
You two, leave.

174
08:40.200 --> 08:41.200
Gao Fuyuan.

175
08:41.220 --> 08:42.640
Is the Deputy Commander-in-Chief's mind

176
08:42.640 --> 08:44.400
something you can guess?

177
08:44.800 --> 08:47.440
If you have something to say, come over and say it quickly.

178
08:47.440 --> 08:48.360
Hurry up.

179
08:52.320 --> 08:55.630
The Deputy Commander-in-Chief won't let you die unjustly.

180
08:55.630 --> 08:56.990
Deputy Commander-in-Chief.

181
08:56.990 --> 08:58.150
For so many years,

182
08:58.720 --> 09:00.850
I, Gao Fuyuan, have always obeyed you.

183
09:01.870 --> 09:03.120
But today,

184
09:04.480 --> 09:05.810
I refuse to accept this.

185
09:07.910 --> 09:08.840
Alright.

186
09:10.180 --> 09:11.270
I'll let you speak.

187
09:11.580 --> 09:13.730
Pour out whatever you have to say.

188
09:14.150 --> 09:17.120
Let me see how you've been brainwashed.

189
09:23.650 --> 09:25.030
Deputy Commander-in-Chief,

190
09:25.030 --> 09:27.360
you are the head of our Northeastern Army.

191
09:28.720 --> 09:31.320
You also have some words engraved on your head:

192
09:31.550 --> 09:33.960
national hatred and family feud.

193
09:36.610 --> 09:39.030
We followed you to fight the Red Army for years.

194
09:39.030 --> 09:41.000
What is the result now?

195
09:42.790 --> 09:45.270
The 619th Regiment is gone.

196
09:46.080 --> 09:48.550
The 109th Division is gone.

197
09:48.790 --> 09:51.390
The 110th Division is gone!

198
09:51.550 --> 09:53.790
But how did Chiang treat us?

199
09:54.510 --> 09:56.490
He revoked our designations!

200
09:57.440 --> 09:59.100
If we keep fighting like this,

201
09:59.130 --> 10:01.260
our Northeastern Army will collapse.

202
10:02.550 --> 10:03.840
Deputy Commander-in-Chief,

203
10:03.840 --> 10:05.260
have you ever thought about

204
10:05.260 --> 10:08.360
how we will explain this to the Old Marshal in the future?

205
10:08.360 --> 10:10.960
How will we explain this to the fellow villagers in the Northeast?

206
10:10.960 --> 10:13.630
How will we explain this to all the Chinese people?

207
10:13.630 --> 10:15.080
You fought poorly,

208
10:15.100 --> 10:17.080
and the battle turned out like this!

209
10:17.080 --> 10:18.340
You want me to explain?

210
10:22.890 --> 10:24.890
Why can't we beat the Red Army?

211
10:25.480 --> 10:27.140
Deputy Commander-in-Chief,

212
10:27.150 --> 10:29.000
this is what I want to tell you.

213
10:30.390 --> 10:32.250
Do you still remember Xu Haidong?

214
10:34.440 --> 10:35.750
An old acquaintance.

215
10:36.960 --> 10:38.390
The day I was captured,

216
10:38.870 --> 10:39.920
he asked me a question.

217
10:39.920 --> 10:40.980
What did he ask you?

218
10:41.720 --> 10:42.720
He asked me,

219
10:43.000 --> 10:45.200
"Your Northeastern Army has such good fortifications,

220
10:45.200 --> 10:48.270
and your weapons and equipment are much better than our Red Army's.

221
10:48.270 --> 10:50.960
But you lost this battle again.

222
10:51.270 --> 10:52.320
Why?"

223
10:52.960 --> 10:54.320
How did you answer him?

224
10:54.670 --> 10:55.910
He answered it for me.

225
10:56.270 --> 10:57.080
He said,

226
10:57.200 --> 10:59.870
"Because the fighting spirit of your Northeastern Army

227
10:59.870 --> 11:01.400
is getting worse and worse.

228
11:01.670 --> 11:04.740
Because we all remember that saying:

229
11:05.160 --> 11:09.260
Chinese don't fight Chinese."

230
11:15.240 --> 11:16.900
Deputy Commander-in-Chief,

231
11:17.200 --> 11:18.750
I think he's right.

232
11:18.940 --> 11:21.000
Our Northeastern Army is not a coward.

233
11:21.000 --> 11:23.120
In the Battle of Gubeikou in 1933,

234
11:23.390 --> 11:25.960
our 67th Army and the 17th Army

235
11:26.030 --> 11:27.690
fought a fierce and bloody battle with the Japanese 8th Division

236
11:27.690 --> 11:30.180
for a full 75 days!

237
11:30.910 --> 11:32.360
The bricks on the Great Wall

238
11:32.360 --> 11:34.380
were all dyed red

239
11:34.410 --> 11:37.030
by the blood of our Northeastern Army soldiers!

240
11:37.030 --> 11:38.630
If it weren't for Generalissimo Chiang

241
11:38.630 --> 11:40.570
playing that "pacify the interior before resisting foreign aggression" trick

242
11:40.570 --> 11:42.660
and transferring us to the Dabie Mountains to suppress the Communists,

243
11:42.660 --> 11:45.590
our men would have fought the Japanese to the last man

244
11:47.030 --> 11:48.490
and died without regrets.

245
11:52.390 --> 11:55.190
So the National Army doesn't resist the Japanese,

246
11:55.550 --> 11:57.150
but the Communist Army does?

247
11:57.550 --> 11:58.910
Aren't they fighting a civil war

248
11:58.910 --> 12:00.360
with us right now?

249
12:00.380 --> 12:02.040
Deputy Commander-in-Chief,

250
12:02.060 --> 12:05.240
we are the ones stopping them from resisting the Japanese now.

251
12:05.240 --> 12:06.380
The Communist Party established the People's Revolutionary Army

252
12:06.380 --> 12:07.850
in the Northeast.

253
12:07.980 --> 12:09.450
Several troops

254
12:09.720 --> 12:12.680
have been fighting the Japanese in the freezing cold for years.

255
12:12.680 --> 12:15.790
And they are not only resisting the Japanese in the Northeast.

256
12:15.790 --> 12:17.670
Their Central Committee just finished a meeting

257
12:17.670 --> 12:19.870
and wants to establish an Anti-Japanese National United Front.

258
12:19.870 --> 12:22.070
Anti-Japanese National United Front?

259
12:22.320 --> 12:23.080
Yes.

260
12:23.290 --> 12:25.790
The main guiding principle of this united front is

261
12:25.790 --> 12:27.510
to call for an end to the civil war

262
12:27.510 --> 12:29.390
and unite all forces willing to resist Japan

263
12:29.390 --> 12:30.870
to fight against Japan together.

264
12:30.870 --> 12:32.200
That's what they say,

265
12:32.320 --> 12:33.790
and that's what they do.

266
12:34.120 --> 12:35.910
Not to mention the Red Army in northern Shaanxi.

267
12:35.910 --> 12:37.150
I heard that in October,

268
12:37.150 --> 12:39.080
the anti-Japanese generals of the Communist Party in the Northeast

269
12:39.080 --> 12:41.240
sent a telegram to the military and political leaders inside the Pass,

270
12:41.240 --> 12:43.960
proposing that regardless of party affiliation, belief,

271
12:43.960 --> 12:45.550
profession, or native place,

272
12:45.550 --> 12:46.880
everyone should unite,

273
12:47.080 --> 12:48.140
stop the civil war,

274
12:48.200 --> 12:50.530
and point their guns at the foreign enemy.

275
12:51.270 --> 12:52.930
Deputy Commander-in-Chief.

276
12:54.720 --> 12:56.150
Deputy Commander-in-Chief,

277
12:56.150 --> 12:59.470
I've said everything I wanted to say to you.

278
13:00.120 --> 13:01.720
If you still want to shoot me,

279
13:03.630 --> 13:04.830
I have no complaints.

280
13:13.150 --> 13:15.560
If I shoot you now,

281
13:16.970 --> 13:19.430
wouldn't I become a sinner who destroyed the

282
13:20.270 --> 13:23.120
Anti-Japanese National United Front?

283
13:24.440 --> 13:26.750
In the 20th year of the Republic of China (1931),

284
13:26.750 --> 13:28.720
I was made the scapegoat.

285
13:28.870 --> 13:29.600
Why are you now

286
13:29.600 --> 13:31.240
planning to let me continue to take the blame?

287
13:31.240 --> 13:32.030
You agreed?

288
13:32.080 --> 13:32.770
Agreed to what?

289
13:32.770 --> 13:35.630
To fight against Japan together with the Communist Party.

290
13:35.630 --> 13:36.870
For such a big matter,

291
13:36.960 --> 13:38.390
do you think you, Gao Fuyuan, standing here

292
13:38.390 --> 13:39.200
and dropping

293
13:39.200 --> 13:40.440
a few tears

294
13:40.480 --> 13:42.010
will make me make up my mind?

295
13:43.260 --> 13:44.900
You're being too naive.

296
13:45.750 --> 13:46.630
Yes.

297
13:47.550 --> 13:48.910
Before I came,

298
13:49.160 --> 13:52.040
Peng Dehuai and Zhou Enlai of the Communist Party

299
13:52.200 --> 13:53.030
both met me.

300
13:53.240 --> 13:55.470
Oh, Mao Zedong also met me.

301
13:56.150 --> 13:57.750
They only have one attitude:

302
13:57.750 --> 13:59.800
they are willing to negotiate with you, Deputy Commander-in-Chief,

303
13:59.800 --> 14:03.370
on a truce and joint resistance against Japan at any time.

304
14:08.380 --> 14:09.420
You've met so many

305
14:09.450 --> 14:11.310
big shots of the Communist Party?

306
14:11.590 --> 14:12.430
I did.

307
14:12.660 --> 14:14.740
Mao Zedong even gave us a lecture.

308
14:15.970 --> 14:17.860
What kind of person is Mao Zedong?

309
14:18.120 --> 14:19.080
He's quite tall,

310
14:19.650 --> 14:20.480
quite thin,

311
14:20.820 --> 14:22.110
his hair is long,

312
14:22.440 --> 14:23.750
and his clothes are full of patches.

313
14:23.750 --> 14:24.870
His hands... he has been...

314
14:24.870 --> 14:26.800
I didn't ask about his appearance!

315
14:30.000 --> 14:32.000
He doesn't put on any airs.

316
14:32.210 --> 14:33.450
He's humorous.

317
14:33.790 --> 14:35.930
When he speaks, he quotes extensively

318
14:36.630 --> 14:38.120
and is very clear.

319
14:38.520 --> 14:40.520
What did he say when he found out

320
14:41.390 --> 14:42.590
you were coming back?

321
14:42.750 --> 14:43.720
He said,

322
14:44.000 --> 14:45.870
when you see Deputy Commander-in-Chief Zhang,

323
14:45.870 --> 14:47.360
say hello to him for me.

324
14:47.630 --> 14:48.840
Please tell him,

325
14:49.240 --> 14:52.020
"Brothers may quarrel at home, but they unite against outside insults.

326
14:52.020 --> 14:54.550
The gunshots in Zhiluo Town are very harsh,

327
14:55.390 --> 14:57.590
just like the Beidaying five years ago.

328
14:57.700 --> 15:01.550
I think General Xueliang feels the same way.

329
15:01.960 --> 15:03.390
With foreign enemies invading,

330
15:03.390 --> 15:05.600
I hope we will never do things that

331
15:05.870 --> 15:08.730
sadden our friends and gladden our enemies again."

332
15:12.500 --> 15:13.830
Dingfang (Wang Yizhe),

333
15:15.610 --> 15:16.730
what do you think?

334
15:19.080 --> 15:20.380
Deputy Commander-in-Chief,

335
15:20.380 --> 15:22.240
we must not lose this opportunity.

336
15:22.240 --> 15:23.890
We must make a prompt decision.

337
15:23.890 --> 15:27.730
It's time to take a step forward.

338
16:06.150 --> 16:07.410
Does Mao Zedong smoke?

339
16:07.900 --> 16:08.630
Yes, he does.

340
16:09.550 --> 16:10.950
What brand does he smoke?

341
16:12.200 --> 16:13.960
When he gave us lectures,

342
16:13.980 --> 16:17.110
he smoked a kind of old dry tobacco rolled in paper tubes.

343
16:17.890 --> 16:20.300
You said his clothes were covered in patches?

344
16:20.300 --> 16:21.060
Yes.

345
16:21.790 --> 16:22.720
On the pant legs,

346
16:22.720 --> 16:23.600
on the collar,

347
16:23.620 --> 16:24.600
and on the cuffs.

348
16:25.360 --> 16:26.360
What do they eat?

349
16:26.970 --> 16:28.100
They don't eat well.

350
16:28.390 --> 16:30.320
Besides wild vegetable paste,

351
16:30.400 --> 16:31.660
it's just black beans.

352
16:31.780 --> 16:33.320
Even coarse grain pancakes are rare.

353
16:33.320 --> 16:34.670
Then why haven't you lost weight?

354
16:34.670 --> 16:36.650
I...

355
16:37.630 --> 16:39.120
I ate special meals.

356
16:39.360 --> 16:40.330
The Communist Party

357
16:40.330 --> 16:42.120
set up a special study class for officers

358
16:42.120 --> 16:43.580
of the Northeastern Army.

359
16:43.690 --> 16:45.490
We all studied in the class.

360
16:45.790 --> 16:48.550
We ate better than their officers and soldiers.

361
16:48.630 --> 16:50.550
And many of their officers and soldiers

362
16:50.550 --> 16:51.750
wore thin clothes.

363
16:51.870 --> 16:54.400
They saved the cotton-padded jackets for us.

364
16:56.070 --> 16:57.400
Officers and soldiers?

365
16:58.620 --> 17:01.690
You don't even call them commanders now.

366
17:02.110 --> 17:05.109
I'd say he's been completely converted to Communism.

367
17:08.349 --> 17:09.609
Shao Qing (Gao Fuyuan)

368
17:10.890 --> 17:11.589
Yes.

369
17:15.990 --> 17:18.030
I will write a personal letter

370
17:18.270 --> 17:19.920
to the Communist Party.

371
17:20.480 --> 17:21.530
You take it back.

372
17:21.790 --> 17:25.390
Ask them to send an official representative as soon as possible,

373
17:25.829 --> 17:27.290
so we can talk face to face.

374
17:30.080 --> 17:30.730
Yes!

375
17:34.000 --> 17:34.800
Yes!

376
17:38.910 --> 17:40.430
You're crying again,

377
17:41.480 --> 17:42.270
just like a wronged little wife!

378
17:42.270 --> 17:43.950
No, Deputy Commander-in-Chief.

379
17:43.950 --> 17:45.030
I'm just happy.

380
17:45.330 --> 17:47.860
I remembered when I first arrived in Wayaobu,

381
17:47.890 --> 17:49.880
the Communist Party's propaganda troupe

382
17:49.880 --> 17:51.670
performed a living newspaper play

383
17:51.670 --> 17:53.840
called "You Took the Wrong Path."

384
17:54.430 --> 17:56.480
It was about a Regiment Commander of the Northeastern Army

385
17:56.480 --> 17:57.720
who didn't fight the Japanese,

386
17:57.720 --> 17:59.160
but only fought the civil war!

387
17:59.160 --> 18:00.610
I felt so suffocated.

388
18:01.510 --> 18:02.810
With all my grievances,

389
18:02.810 --> 18:04.680
it made me burst into tears.

390
18:05.400 --> 18:06.790
It's all good now.

391
18:07.240 --> 18:09.720
Now we are on the right path.

392
18:10.030 --> 18:11.200
Let me tell you,

393
18:11.480 --> 18:13.850
the Deputy Commander-in-Chief was in Shanghai a few days ago

394
18:13.850 --> 18:16.850
and read the Communist Party's August 1 Declaration.

395
18:17.270 --> 18:19.680
He has wanted to unite with the Communist Party to resist Japan

396
18:19.680 --> 18:21.270
for more than a day or two.

397
18:21.750 --> 18:24.570
He was just worrying about how to contact the Communist Party,

398
18:24.570 --> 18:27.320
and here you are back.

399
18:28.450 --> 18:30.690
Then I came back at the right time!

400
18:37.290 --> 18:41.590
The words you brought are still late.

401
18:42.810 --> 18:46.300
If I had heard these words back then

402
18:48.010 --> 18:50.750
in September 18, 1931,

403
18:56.950 --> 18:58.810
how wonderful it would have been.

404
19:17.410 --> 19:23.010
[Wayaobu, Shaanxi]

405
19:18.130 --> 19:21.820
Now I announce the resolution of this meeting.

406
19:22.400 --> 19:24.310
This meeting decides

407
19:24.400 --> 19:25.900
that the eastern expedition to Shanxi

408
19:25.900 --> 19:28.750
will take place in February 1936.

409
19:29.350 --> 19:31.970
During the eastern expedition of the main force of the Red Army,

410
19:31.970 --> 19:34.170
I, Comrade Mao Zedong,

411
19:34.510 --> 19:35.480
Comrade Peng Dehuai,

412
19:35.480 --> 19:36.480
Zhang Hao (Lin Yuying),

413
19:36.480 --> 19:37.290
and Comrade Kai Feng

414
19:37.290 --> 19:39.420
will move with the 1st Front Red Army.

415
19:40.000 --> 19:41.130
Comrade Peng Dehuai

416
19:41.200 --> 19:42.220
and Comrade Zhang Hao

417
19:42.220 --> 19:44.000
will participate in the work of the Politburo.

418
19:44.000 --> 19:44.930
At the same time,

419
19:45.350 --> 19:47.510
Comrade Zhou Enlai,

420
19:47.920 --> 19:49.070
Comrade Bo Gu,

421
19:49.400 --> 19:50.460
and Comrade Deng Fa

422
19:50.550 --> 19:53.440
will form the Northwest Central Bureau of the CPC

423
19:53.720 --> 19:55.400
to take charge of the rear-area work

424
19:55.400 --> 19:58.310
and persist in the struggle in the Shaanxi-Gansu Soviet Area.

425
19:58.310 --> 20:00.640
Comrade Zhou Enlai will serve as the secretary.

426
20:00.640 --> 20:02.750
After Comrade Wang Jiaxiang recovers from his illness,

427
20:02.750 --> 20:05.150
he will participate in the rear-area work.

428
20:05.400 --> 20:06.310
In addition,

429
20:06.400 --> 20:08.840
in order to strengthen the leadership of the Northern Bureau,

430
20:08.840 --> 20:11.170
the Central Committee needs to send capable comrades there.

431
20:11.170 --> 20:12.480
The Politburo has decided to send

432
20:12.480 --> 20:14.480
Comrade Liu Shaoqi to Tianjin

433
20:14.750 --> 20:16.700
as the representative of the CPC Central Committee

434
20:16.700 --> 20:18.920
to guide the work of the Northern Bureau,

435
20:18.920 --> 20:21.850
implement the spirit of the Wayaobu Conference resolution,

436
20:21.850 --> 20:24.600
and further open up the situation in North China.

437
20:24.890 --> 20:26.720
I have another piece of good news

438
20:26.750 --> 20:28.080
to share with everyone.

439
20:28.170 --> 20:30.610
Gao Fuyuan, with a handwritten letter from Zhang Xueliang,

440
20:30.610 --> 20:31.910
has returned from Luochuan.

441
20:31.910 --> 20:35.190
In the letter, he agreed to our full-scale

442
20:35.270 --> 20:37.750
negotiations on a ceasefire and joint resistance against Japan.

443
20:37.750 --> 20:39.700
We are preparing to send Comrade Li Kenong

444
20:39.700 --> 20:41.190
as the official representative

445
20:41.190 --> 20:43.540
to conduct preliminary negotiations with Zhang Xueliang.

446
20:43.540 --> 20:45.490
Good, good!

447
20:46.210 --> 20:47.100
Wonderful.

448
20:49.110 --> 20:51.510
The south is blocked, but the north is open.

449
20:52.110 --> 20:53.480
Both have the surname Zhang,

450
20:53.480 --> 20:54.920
but on the issue of resisting Japan,

451
20:54.920 --> 20:56.030
Zhang Xueliang's vision

452
20:56.030 --> 20:59.710
is much broader than that of the Zhang in the south.

453
21:03.070 --> 21:04.310
Since last month,

454
21:04.740 --> 21:07.110
Zhang Guotao and I have communicated via telegram several times.

455
21:07.110 --> 21:09.310
Although he stated that he obeys the Communist International,

456
21:09.310 --> 21:10.340
he still refuses to admit

457
21:10.340 --> 21:11.770
his mistake of setting up a separate "Central Committee,"

458
21:11.480 --> 21:13.300
[Lin Yuying (Zhang Hao), Member of the CPC delegation to the Comintern]

459
21:11.870 --> 21:13.750
and his attitude is very tough.

460
21:14.110 --> 21:16.640
I also sent him a telegram in my personal capacity,

461
21:16.640 --> 21:19.070
asking him to cancel the provisional "Central Committee."

462
21:19.070 --> 21:20.000
At the same time,

463
21:20.030 --> 21:22.750
I informed him of the Wayaobu Conference resolution,

464
21:22.750 --> 21:26.750
but there has been no reply so far.

465
21:34.990 --> 21:39.520
[Headquarters of the Red 4th Front Army, Renjiaba, Sichuan]

466
21:36.640 --> 21:38.580
Currently, the supplies of all troops

467
21:38.580 --> 21:39.780
have encountered problems.

468
21:39.680 --> 21:44.560
[Chen Changhao, Political Commissar of the Red 4th Front Army]

469
21:40.160 --> 21:43.290
Especially for the Red 5th Army stationed in Danba area,

470
21:43.500 --> 21:45.270
the situation is the most serious.

471
21:45.270 --> 21:46.920
According to Huang Chao's report,

472
21:46.920 --> 21:47.720
the troops now

473
21:47.720 --> 21:50.120
can only eat one meal of corn porridge a day,

474
21:50.160 --> 21:53.220
and mostly satisfy their hunger with wild vegetables.

475
21:53.850 --> 21:55.570
The soldiers are still wearing unlined garments,

476
21:55.570 --> 21:56.900
and firewood is scarce,

477
21:57.270 --> 21:59.400
making it very difficult to keep warm.

478
22:00.480 --> 22:02.280
Due to freezing and starvation,

479
22:02.640 --> 22:05.370
the attrition rate of the troops is very serious.

480
22:09.920 --> 22:10.790
Then can we

481
22:11.330 --> 22:13.660
send someone to deliver some food to them?

482
22:15.880 --> 22:18.950
Other troops don't have enough food either.

483
22:19.230 --> 22:20.120
Moreover,

484
22:21.270 --> 22:24.870
the west of Jiajin Mountain is now blocked by heavy snow,

485
22:25.590 --> 22:27.520
making it completely impassable.

486
22:44.680 --> 22:46.410
Lin Yuying said in the telegram

487
22:46.750 --> 22:49.810
that he has the code to communicate with the Comintern.

488
22:49.920 --> 22:50.810
This shows

489
22:51.070 --> 22:54.730
that the northern Shaanxi side is consistent with the Comintern.

490
22:55.270 --> 22:56.070
From the

491
22:56.070 --> 22:58.660
resolution of the Wayaobu Conference they sent,

492
22:58.660 --> 22:59.790
we can also see this.

493
23:00.400 --> 23:01.640
The establishment

494
23:01.710 --> 23:03.880
of an Anti-Japanese National United Front proposed in the resolution

495
23:03.880 --> 23:06.880
is in line with the spirit of the August 1 Declaration.

496
23:08.110 --> 23:09.550
This is not just my idea.

497
23:10.110 --> 23:11.030
Right now,

498
23:11.920 --> 23:13.880
many cadres are discussing this.

499
23:14.550 --> 23:16.110
Lin Yuying?

500
23:16.550 --> 23:18.400
Is what he says always right?

501
23:18.920 --> 23:20.690
Since the Comintern sent him to solve

502
23:20.690 --> 23:22.830
the problems of the 1st and the 4th Front Army,

503
23:22.830 --> 23:24.810
he can't just stay in northern Shaanxi

504
23:24.810 --> 23:26.640
and listen to their side of the story.

505
23:26.640 --> 23:28.170
I'll reply to him right now.

506
23:48.980 --> 23:50.500
Comrades, comrades!

507
23:50.640 --> 23:52.160
Zhang Guotao replied to me.

508
23:52.160 --> 23:53.110
What did he say?

509
23:53.850 --> 23:54.680
He said,

510
23:54.720 --> 23:57.110
"For the unity of the Party and to face the enemy together,

511
23:57.110 --> 23:58.920
please tell the comrades in northern Shaanxi

512
23:58.920 --> 24:00.300
to automatically cancel the title of the 'Central Committee.'

513
24:00.300 --> 24:02.250
Internal Party disputes should be resolved by Comintern."

514
24:02.250 --> 24:04.350
He also hopes for "an immediate reply."

515
24:04.350 --> 24:05.310
Seven days ago,

516
24:05.440 --> 24:07.610
I sent him a telegram in my own name,

517
24:07.750 --> 24:08.550
warning him

518
24:08.720 --> 24:11.510
to automatically cancel his provisional "Central Committee."

519
24:11.510 --> 24:12.310
Now he

520
24:12.570 --> 24:14.630
wants us to cancel it instead.

521
24:15.590 --> 24:16.510
It seems

522
24:16.720 --> 24:19.310
all our previous efforts

523
24:19.540 --> 24:20.580
were in vain.

524
24:20.830 --> 24:22.660
Actually, rom this telegram,

525
24:23.330 --> 24:25.640
I can see Zhang Guotao's guilty conscience.

526
24:25.640 --> 24:26.750
He is currently

527
24:26.890 --> 24:28.950
in a military predicament, isn't he?

528
24:29.240 --> 24:30.270
This confirms the Central Committee's

529
24:30.270 --> 24:33.030
initial judgment of his southward strategy.

530
24:33.160 --> 24:34.600
If we can see it,

531
24:35.130 --> 24:37.070
can't the vast number of southward officers and soldiers

532
24:37.070 --> 24:38.200
see it too?

533
24:39.510 --> 24:41.710
I agree with Comrade Enlai's judgment.

534
24:41.920 --> 24:44.590
Zhang Guotao is now in a dilemma.

535
24:44.830 --> 24:46.310
He has long lost

536
24:46.400 --> 24:49.600
the confidence he had before the Battle of Baizhangguan.

537
24:50.330 --> 24:52.790
Besides, the Central Committee has already

538
24:52.810 --> 24:54.350
made many concessions to him.

539
24:54.350 --> 24:56.030
But on bottom-line issues,

540
24:56.100 --> 24:58.160
we absolutely cannot yield anymore.

541
24:59.240 --> 25:00.260
Comrade Zhang Hao,

542
25:00.260 --> 25:01.750
as early as the E'jie Meeting,

543
25:01.750 --> 25:03.270
our Politburo

544
25:03.290 --> 25:04.220
already passed

545
25:04.350 --> 25:06.400
the Decision on Comrade Zhang Guotao's Errors.

546
25:06.400 --> 25:07.400
At that time, we considered

547
25:07.400 --> 25:09.420
that there was still room to educate and save him.

548
25:09.420 --> 25:10.750
So it was not published.

549
25:11.350 --> 25:12.240
I think now

550
25:12.440 --> 25:14.840
is the time to publish it to the whole Party.

551
25:16.570 --> 25:17.650
Yes, let's go

552
25:17.730 --> 25:19.720
discuss it with Comrade Zedong immediately

553
25:19.720 --> 25:22.650
and convene a Politburo meeting as soon as possible.

554
25:24.590 --> 25:27.030
On January 22, 1936,

555
25:27.690 --> 25:29.980
the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee issued

556
25:29.980 --> 25:34.500
The Decision on Comrade Zhang Guotao's Establishment of a Second "Central Committee."

557
25:34.500 --> 25:35.650
Besides demanding that Zhang Guotao

558
25:35.650 --> 25:38.180
immediately cancel all his "Central" titles

559
25:38.240 --> 25:40.500
and abandon all anti-Party tendencies,

560
25:40.750 --> 25:43.120
it specifically decided to publish within the Party

561
25:43.120 --> 25:45.780
the Decision on Comrade Zhang Guotao's Errors,

562
25:46.040 --> 25:48.170
which was made by the Central Committee

563
25:48.170 --> 25:50.890
at the E'jie Meeting on September 12, 1935.

564
25:51.470 --> 25:53.080
Once the decision was published,

565
25:53.080 --> 25:56.740
it immediately caused a huge repercussion throughout the Party.

566
25:58.230 --> 25:59.880
On January 23,

567
26:00.030 --> 26:02.680
Zhu De broke through Zhang Guotao's obstruction

568
26:02.680 --> 26:04.390
and again sent a telegram in his own name

569
26:04.390 --> 26:07.360
to Zhang Wentian, the general person in charge of the Central Committee,

570
26:07.360 --> 26:10.750
stating that the revolution was in a new climax,

571
26:11.070 --> 26:12.970
and the Party urgently needed to achieve unity

572
26:12.970 --> 26:14.620
to strive for victory,

573
26:14.860 --> 26:18.380
expressing the attitude of the vast majority of officers and soldiers.

574
26:18.380 --> 26:19.930
On January 24,

575
26:19.950 --> 26:22.920
Lin Yuying again sent a telegram to Zhang Guotao and Zhu De,

576
26:22.920 --> 26:24.840
clarifying his position.

577
26:25.590 --> 26:26.760
Facing reality,

578
26:26.950 --> 26:30.160
Zhang Guotao finally couldn't withstand the immense pressure

579
26:30.160 --> 26:32.150
and subsequently convened a meeting of senior cadres

580
26:32.150 --> 26:34.110
at Renjiaba in Lushan County

581
26:34.400 --> 26:36.640
to discuss the next course of action.

582
26:39.380 --> 26:41.210
Comrades Guotao and Zhu De.

583
26:42.130 --> 26:42.930
First,

584
26:43.850 --> 26:46.500
the Comintern fully agrees with

585
26:46.610 --> 26:49.080
the political line of the CPC Central Committee.

586
26:49.080 --> 26:49.940
And it believes

587
26:49.990 --> 26:52.920
that in the Comintern's ranks,

588
26:53.580 --> 26:54.790
apart from Communist Party of the Soviet Union,

589
26:54.790 --> 26:56.530
the CPC occupies the foremost position.

590
26:56.530 --> 26:59.260
The Chinese revolution has become a great factor

591
26:59.290 --> 27:00.690
in the world revolution.

592
27:00.900 --> 27:02.980
The Chinese Red Army holds

593
27:03.000 --> 27:04.730
a very high status in the world.

594
27:04.970 --> 27:07.030
The Long March of the Central Red Army

595
27:08.540 --> 27:09.500
is a victory.

596
27:10.660 --> 27:11.450
Second,

597
27:11.810 --> 27:14.520
you can immediately establish the Southwest Bureau,

598
27:14.520 --> 27:15.760
which will be directly under the delegation.

599
27:15.760 --> 27:18.950
[Xu Xiangqian, Commander-in-Chief of the 4th Front Army]

600
27:16.010 --> 27:19.250
Your principled disputes with the Central Committee

601
27:19.280 --> 27:22.080
can be submitted to the Comintern for resolution.

602
27:24.260 --> 27:25.260
Comrade Guotao,

603
27:26.010 --> 27:27.210
what's your opinion?

604
27:30.750 --> 27:31.590
Changhao,

605
27:32.760 --> 27:34.390
I want to hear your opinion.

606
27:38.970 --> 27:40.010
I agree.

607
27:40.590 --> 27:42.700
Based on the new strategic line,

608
27:42.920 --> 27:43.840
we should unite

609
27:43.990 --> 27:45.650
and fight the enemy together.

610
27:46.030 --> 27:46.750
I agree.

611
27:46.800 --> 27:47.520
I agree.

612
27:47.710 --> 27:48.380
I agree.

613
27:56.620 --> 27:57.620
You

614
28:00.210 --> 28:01.410
all want to turn back?

615
28:02.030 --> 28:04.450
The proposal put forward by Comrades Lin Yuying and Luofu

616
28:04.450 --> 28:05.980
that we set up a Southwest Bureau

617
28:05.980 --> 28:06.890
directly under the leadership

618
28:06.890 --> 28:09.290
of our Party's delegation to the Comintern

619
28:09.400 --> 28:11.260
shows that the Central Committee

620
28:11.490 --> 28:13.150
is still leaving us some room.

621
28:16.860 --> 28:18.190
The Central Committee?

622
28:20.450 --> 28:22.820
Nominally, we are under

623
28:23.030 --> 28:26.030
the leadership of the delegation to the Comintern,

624
28:26.330 --> 28:27.460
but in the end,

625
28:27.740 --> 28:29.580
don't we still have to listen to Lin Yuying?

626
28:29.580 --> 28:31.040
Yes! We...

627
28:33.750 --> 28:35.270
We can't even contact

628
28:35.380 --> 28:37.300
the delegation to the Comintern!

629
28:39.010 --> 28:40.170
Comrade Guotao,

630
28:40.700 --> 28:42.230
it's never too late to mend.

631
28:42.720 --> 28:43.770
Anyway, I think

632
28:44.310 --> 28:46.110
the Comintern praised them

633
28:46.610 --> 28:47.930
just to inspire

634
28:47.960 --> 28:50.530
the fighting spirit of the officers and soldiers,

635
28:50.530 --> 28:51.660
but it doesn't mean

636
28:51.850 --> 28:54.910
we shouldn't summarize the lessons of their mistakes.

637
28:54.980 --> 28:56.890
Then again, Yujie,

638
28:57.650 --> 28:59.500
we didn't make public

639
28:59.590 --> 29:01.840
the resolution of the Zhuomudiao Meeting, right?

640
29:01.840 --> 29:04.190
Nor did we make an organizational conclusion

641
29:04.190 --> 29:05.600
on the mistakes of Mao, Zhang, and Zhou,

642
29:05.600 --> 29:07.960
let alone inform the 2nd and 6th Corps.

643
29:08.290 --> 29:10.860
We did this for the sake of unity.

644
29:11.250 --> 29:12.050
Good.

645
29:13.380 --> 29:14.340
Comrade Guotao,

646
29:16.320 --> 29:18.260
I'm glad to hear the word

647
29:19.320 --> 29:20.870
"unity" from you.

648
29:21.760 --> 29:22.800
I think

649
29:23.210 --> 29:26.100
unity is right.

650
29:26.130 --> 29:28.650
Comrade Lin Yuying also mentioned in the telegram

651
29:28.650 --> 29:29.830
that the dispute between the two sides

652
29:29.830 --> 29:31.830
can be resolved by the Comintern.

653
29:31.970 --> 29:34.150
But you have to show your attitude.

654
29:34.570 --> 29:35.530
In action,

655
29:35.760 --> 29:38.890
you have to give an explanation to the Comintern, right?

656
30:16.480 --> 30:17.260
In principle,

657
30:17.260 --> 30:20.260
I agree with the resolution of the Wayaobu Conference.

658
30:20.260 --> 30:20.940
Of course,

659
30:21.180 --> 30:23.700
I will also send a telegram to Comrade Lin Yuying

660
30:23.700 --> 30:24.960
to express my opinion.

661
30:25.300 --> 30:26.890
But overall,

662
30:27.390 --> 30:28.870
I still hope

663
30:29.210 --> 30:32.010
to seek unity within the Party as soon as possible.

664
30:37.980 --> 30:39.070
Comrade Guotao,

665
30:39.750 --> 30:41.280
it's good to have your word.

666
30:42.080 --> 30:43.410
There's no time to lose.

667
30:46.390 --> 30:47.240
Comrades,

668
30:50.880 --> 30:52.080
it's time to turn around.

669
30:52.080 --> 30:52.710
Right.

670
30:55.700 --> 30:58.030
Under the unanimous opinion of everyone,

671
30:58.170 --> 31:00.680
although Zhang Guotao still tried every means

672
31:00.680 --> 31:02.090
to quibble over his mistakes

673
31:02.090 --> 31:05.010
and did not immediately cancel the separate "Central Committee,"

674
31:05.010 --> 31:06.560
he had to accept

675
31:06.580 --> 31:09.910
the reality that his southward plan had completely failed.

676
31:10.950 --> 31:12.910
In early February 1936,

677
31:13.270 --> 31:14.700
at the suggestion of Xu Xiangqian,

678
31:14.700 --> 31:16.430
the southbound Red Army troops

679
31:16.650 --> 31:17.330
formulated

680
31:17.530 --> 31:19.790
Kangding-Daofu-Luhuo Campaign Plan.

681
31:20.190 --> 31:21.230
They divided into three troops

682
31:21.230 --> 31:25.160
and gradually withdrew from the Tianquan, Lushan, and Baoxing areas,

683
31:25.500 --> 31:27.820
planning to pass through the Dawei and Maogong areas

684
31:27.820 --> 31:29.480
to transfer to the northwest.

685
31:29.630 --> 31:30.430
At this point,

686
31:30.470 --> 31:33.730
Zhang Guotao's southbound policy was declared a failure.

687
31:52.350 --> 31:53.060
Report.

688
31:54.020 --> 31:54.930
Commander Peng.

689
31:54.930 --> 31:56.060
An urgent telegram.

690
32:05.360 --> 32:06.600
Mao!

691
32:08.190 --> 32:09.710
A telegram!

692
32:10.600 --> 32:12.600
So the comrades of the 4th Front Army

693
32:12.680 --> 32:14.240
have gone north, right?

694
32:14.410 --> 32:15.330
Yes!

695
32:15.500 --> 32:17.100
It's going to be hard on them.

696
32:17.180 --> 32:18.670
They have to climb the snow mountains

697
32:18.670 --> 32:20.330
and cross the grasslands too!

698
32:24.690 --> 32:26.700
In February 1936,

699
32:27.300 --> 32:28.850
The 1st Front Red Army

700
32:28.850 --> 32:31.570
rushed to the Yellow River crossing

701
32:31.610 --> 32:33.670
under the name of the "Chinese People's Red Army Anti-Japanese Vanguard"

702
32:33.670 --> 32:35.600
and began the Eastern Expedition.

703
32:36.390 --> 32:38.540
Mao Zedong served as Political Commissar,

704
32:38.540 --> 32:40.060
Peng Dehuai as Commander,

705
32:40.720 --> 32:42.640
Ye Jianying as Chief of Staff,

706
32:43.220 --> 32:46.550
and Yang Shangkun as Director of the Political Department.

707
32:47.780 --> 32:50.440
Mao Zedong stood on the bank of the Yellow River.

708
32:51.060 --> 32:53.810
The vast sky, the vast snow,

709
32:54.540 --> 32:56.670
and the vast banks of the Yellow River.

710
32:57.100 --> 32:58.750
Endless history and landscapes

711
32:58.750 --> 33:00.200
rushed into his eyes.

712
33:00.850 --> 33:04.770
"I ask the boundless earth: who rules the rise and fall?"

713
33:06.500 --> 33:09.120
The question he asked by the Xiang River more than ten years ago

714
33:09.120 --> 33:11.310
seemed to have a clearer answer.

715
33:12.060 --> 33:14.340
The Red Army troops on the Eastern Expedition across the Yellow River

716
33:14.340 --> 33:17.070
will create a new history for the Chinese nation.

717
33:17.750 --> 33:21.170
Surging poetic feelings stirred in Mao Zedong's chest.

718
33:21.790 --> 33:23.590
A poem, "Qinyuan Spring - Snow,"

719
33:23.700 --> 33:25.320
poured out.

720
33:26.600 --> 33:30.430
North country scene: a hundred leagues locked in ice,

721
33:30.450 --> 33:32.510
a thousand leagues of whirling snow.

722
33:33.110 --> 33:37.110
Both sides of the Great Wall, one single white immensity.

723
33:37.280 --> 33:40.690
The Yellow River's swift current is stilled from end to end.

724
33:42.320 --> 33:45.800
Mountains dancing like silver serpents, highlands racing like wax elephants,

725
33:45.800 --> 33:49.110
vying with heaven in stature.

726
33:50.950 --> 33:54.520
On a fine day, the land, clad in white, adorned in red,

727
33:54.940 --> 33:57.220
grows more enchanting.

728
33:58.320 --> 34:00.680
This land so rich in beauty

729
34:00.830 --> 34:04.330
has made countless heroes bow in homage.

730
34:05.410 --> 34:09.550
But alas! Qin Shihuang and Han Wudi were somewhat deficient in literary talent,

731
34:09.550 --> 34:13.150
and Tang Taizong and Song Taizu had little poetry in their souls;

732
34:13.520 --> 34:16.120
and Genghis Khan, proud Son of Heaven for a day,

733
34:16.230 --> 34:19.659
knew only shooting eagles, bow outstretched.

734
34:20.940 --> 34:24.510
All are past and gone! For truly great men,

735
34:24.719 --> 34:27.219
just look to the present.

736
34:29.239 --> 34:31.630
Nine years later, in 1945,

737
34:31.690 --> 34:34.170
during the Chongqing negotiations,

738
34:34.190 --> 34:38.150
Mao Zedong copied this poem and presented it to his old friend Liu Yazi.

739
34:38.520 --> 34:40.370
On November 14 of the same year,

740
34:40.730 --> 34:42.170
Playwright Wu Zuguang

741
34:42.170 --> 34:43.170
published this poem for the first time

742
34:43.170 --> 34:45.500
in the "Western Night Talks" supplement

743
34:45.500 --> 34:46.770
of the Chongqing Xinmin Bao Evening Edition,

744
34:46.770 --> 34:49.290
which he edited.

745
34:49.290 --> 34:50.250
Once published,

746
34:50.250 --> 34:51.900
it caused a sensation across the country

747
34:51.900 --> 34:53.210
like a thunderbolt.

748
34:55.340 --> 34:58.050
On February 18, 1936,

749
34:58.460 --> 35:02.190
Mao Zedong personally issued the order for the Eastern Expedition.

750
35:02.190 --> 35:04.020
At 20:00 on the 20th,

751
35:04.160 --> 35:06.690
the 1st Front Red Army divided into two troops

752
35:06.760 --> 35:09.970
and launched a river-crossing battle in the area

753
35:10.070 --> 35:12.140
from Suide County to Hekou, Qingjian County in Shaanxi.

754
35:12.140 --> 35:13.460
By the end of February,

755
35:13.720 --> 35:15.100
the Red Army successively broke through

756
35:15.100 --> 35:17.470
the 200-li blockade of the Jinsui Army,

757
35:17.980 --> 35:21.110
occupying the vast areas of Shilou, Zhongyang, Xiaoyi,

758
35:21.290 --> 35:24.870
Xi County, and Yonghe counties.

759
35:26.980 --> 35:32.570
[Yan Xishan's Mansion, Taiyuan, Shanxi]

760
35:28.400 --> 35:32.510
"The greatest enemy of our China is Japanese imperialism.

761
35:32.940 --> 35:35.130
All those who live on this land

762
35:35.350 --> 35:37.350
and are descendants of Yan and Huang

763
35:37.950 --> 35:39.980
should rise up together

764
35:40.100 --> 35:41.640
and unite for the country.

765
35:41.480 --> 35:44.560
[Proclamation of the Chinese People's Red Army Vanguard to Resist Japan]

766
35:41.760 --> 35:44.760
With the skin gone, to what can the hair attach itself?

767
35:45.270 --> 35:48.790
If the nation perishes, what is the point of living?"

768
35:49.210 --> 35:52.650
War is just like doing business.

769
35:52.880 --> 35:54.760
It's not as simple as you eating me

770
35:55.710 --> 35:58.180
or me eating you.

771
35:58.510 --> 36:01.040
We need to find a balance.

772
36:01.980 --> 36:03.380
What is this balance?

773
36:03.400 --> 36:04.800
It's just one word:

774
36:05.430 --> 36:06.060
mean.

775
36:06.080 --> 36:09.300
My philosophy of the "mean"

776
36:10.810 --> 36:13.410
is like dancing on eggs.

777
36:13.700 --> 36:15.680
I don't attach myself to any side,

778
36:15.930 --> 36:17.440
nor do I intensify conflicts.

779
36:17.440 --> 36:20.890
I just want to protect the territory and the people.

780
36:23.320 --> 36:24.800
But nowadays,

781
36:25.130 --> 36:27.260
the situation is very complicated.

782
36:27.840 --> 36:28.800
In the past,

783
36:29.180 --> 36:31.750
I was dancing on the two eggs

784
36:31.910 --> 36:34.100
of Feng Yuxiang and Chiang Kai-shek.

785
36:34.200 --> 36:35.110
Now,

786
36:34.910 --> 36:39.790
[Yan Xishan, Vice Chairman of the Military Affairs Commission of the Kuomintang Government; Director of the Taiyuan Pacification Headquarters]

787
36:35.540 --> 36:37.350
the Communist Army is one egg,

788
36:37.860 --> 36:40.060
Chiang Kai-shek is another,

789
36:39.910 --> 36:42.290
[Zhao Daiwen, Chief Councilor of the Taiyuan Pacification Headquarters of the Kuomintang]

790
36:40.250 --> 36:44.610
and there's a Japanese egg outside the door.

791
36:45.090 --> 36:48.330
I can't touch any of them.

792
36:49.940 --> 36:50.660
How about

793
36:50.910 --> 36:53.620
we let the Communist egg

794
36:54.420 --> 36:57.130
smash directly into the Chiang Kai-shek egg?

795
36:57.650 --> 37:00.210
Director, your idea is brilliant.

796
36:58.840 --> 37:02.760
[Liang Huazhi, Confidential Secretary of the Taiyuan Pacification Headquarters of the Kuomintang]

797
37:01.090 --> 37:03.170
Let them fight each other,

798
37:03.900 --> 37:06.060
and we'll reap the benefits.

799
37:06.310 --> 37:09.990
I don't seek benefits, just to break even.

800
37:11.880 --> 37:15.940
[Nanjing, Jiangsu]

801
37:15.510 --> 37:16.440
Generalissimo.

802
37:16.540 --> 37:18.340
Cixiu (Chen Cheng) has arrived.

803
37:18.530 --> 37:19.970
Cixiu, look.

804
37:20.520 --> 37:22.220
On February 26th in Tokyo, Japan,

805
37:22.220 --> 37:23.700
a military coup took place.

806
37:23.700 --> 37:25.740
No matter the outcome,

807
37:26.080 --> 37:27.640
at least in terms of diplomatic easing,

808
37:27.420 --> 37:29.500
[Qian Dajun, Director of the First Department, Generalissimo's Office, Military Affairs Commission of the Kuomintang Government]

809
37:27.720 --> 37:28.580
it has bought us

810
37:28.610 --> 37:29.940
more than three months.

811
37:30.250 --> 37:30.990
I was thinking,

812
37:30.990 --> 37:32.940
if the young Japanese military officers

813
37:32.940 --> 37:34.290
take power,

814
37:34.550 --> 37:37.210
a war between Japan and the Soviet Union is not impossible.

815
37:37.210 --> 37:38.160
If that's true,

816
37:38.290 --> 37:39.840
it can indeed buy us enough favorable time

817
37:39.840 --> 37:41.370
for our current situation.

818
37:41.390 --> 37:41.990
Yes.

819
37:43.840 --> 37:44.720
Sit.

820
37:44.990 --> 37:45.580
Yes.

821
37:47.590 --> 37:49.590
How is the war in northwest Guizhou?

822
37:50.560 --> 37:51.900
Don't be so formal.

823
37:52.050 --> 37:52.530
Sit.

824
37:52.550 --> 37:53.270
Yes.

825
37:54.790 --> 37:57.410
Our army has reoccupied Qianxi and Dading areas.

826
37:57.410 --> 37:58.760
He and Xiao's troops have been suppressed

827
37:58.760 --> 38:00.520
in a narrow area around Bijie,

828
38:00.600 --> 38:02.300
with no room to maneuver against us.

829
38:02.300 --> 38:03.420
Good.

830
38:03.940 --> 38:05.410
Both are fighting the Communists,

831
38:05.410 --> 38:06.950
but compared to Hanqing (Zhang Xueliang),

832
38:06.950 --> 38:09.010
Cixiu makes me feel much more at ease.

833
38:09.130 --> 38:09.750
Yes.

834
38:10.530 --> 38:14.390
Is the anti-Communist campaign in northern Shaanxi not optimistic?

835
38:15.290 --> 38:16.760
It's not just unoptimistic,

836
38:16.760 --> 38:18.000
it's a total mess.

837
38:20.130 --> 38:21.570
You might not know, Cixiu.

838
38:21.570 --> 38:22.790
The main force of the Communist Army in northern Shaanxi

839
38:22.790 --> 38:25.340
crossed the Yellow River eastward in late February,

840
38:25.340 --> 38:27.380
broke through the Jinsui Army's defense lines,

841
38:27.380 --> 38:29.830
and quickly seized the hub area of four counties.

842
38:29.830 --> 38:31.210
They are spreading like wildfire.

843
38:31.210 --> 38:33.360
Weren't the Communists in northern Shaanxi exhausted

844
38:33.360 --> 38:34.380
and unable to continue?

845
38:34.380 --> 38:37.090
How could they have the strength to cross the Yellow River?

846
38:37.090 --> 38:37.940
Indeed.

847
38:38.010 --> 38:39.470
It is truly unbelievable.

848
38:40.420 --> 38:41.590
Then northern Shaanxi is empty.

849
38:41.590 --> 38:43.120
We can deploy troops there.

850
38:43.250 --> 38:44.250
Not necessarily.

851
38:44.370 --> 38:45.760
The Communist Army's defense forces in northern Shaanxi

852
38:45.760 --> 38:46.690
are still there.

853
38:46.720 --> 38:48.310
Plus, the northern Shaanxi region

854
38:48.310 --> 38:50.110
is vast and has complex terrain.

855
38:50.290 --> 38:51.110
For the time being,

856
38:51.110 --> 38:52.460
it is indeed difficult to carry out an encirclement and suppression campaign.

857
38:52.460 --> 38:54.550
Stop making excuses for Hanqing.

858
38:54.570 --> 38:55.690
I know

859
38:55.830 --> 38:57.830
you two are good friends.

860
38:58.750 --> 38:59.380
Generalissimo.

861
38:59.380 --> 39:00.520
I didn't mean anything else by saying that.

862
39:00.520 --> 39:02.780
If it weren't for his perfunctory attitude,

863
39:02.780 --> 39:03.650
how could the Communist Army

864
39:03.650 --> 39:05.630
cross the Yellow River so easily

865
39:06.500 --> 39:08.430
and show their strength in Shanxi?

866
39:09.140 --> 39:09.800
Cixiu.

867
39:09.820 --> 39:10.530
Yes, sir.

868
39:11.250 --> 39:13.650
What do you think of the current situation?

869
39:14.470 --> 39:15.240
I think

870
39:15.340 --> 39:17.380
the land in northern Shaanxi is barren

871
39:17.380 --> 39:18.360
and supplies are scarce.

872
39:18.360 --> 39:19.240
It is inherently unsuitable for

873
39:19.240 --> 39:21.250
the Communist Army's long-term stationing and development.

874
39:21.250 --> 39:22.650
But Shanxi is different.

875
39:22.770 --> 39:24.970
Once the Communist Army enters Shanxi,

876
39:25.010 --> 39:26.510
obtains a large amount of supplies,

877
39:26.510 --> 39:27.840
or takes root locally,

878
39:28.240 --> 39:30.900
it is highly likely that they will grow stronger again.

879
39:30.900 --> 39:32.130
If this continues,

880
39:32.530 --> 39:34.010
it's not impossible

881
39:34.030 --> 39:35.350
that we might repeat the mistakes of Jiangxi.

882
39:35.350 --> 39:36.540
So my opinion is

883
39:36.690 --> 39:38.690
we must send troops against Shanxi,

884
39:39.170 --> 39:41.920
either to annihilate the Communist Army's effective forces on the spot,

885
39:41.920 --> 39:44.370
or to drive them back to the bitter cold land of northern Shaanxi,

886
39:44.370 --> 39:45.940
making it difficult for them to develop.

887
39:45.940 --> 39:46.940
It's just that

888
39:47.510 --> 39:50.030
Yan Xishan has always been xenophobic.

889
39:50.580 --> 39:51.430
Right.

890
39:51.570 --> 39:53.390
If he wasn't in imminent danger,

891
39:53.480 --> 39:55.480
he wouldn't have sent me a telegram.

892
39:55.950 --> 39:56.990
But now,

893
39:57.200 --> 39:59.060
he personally sent me a telegram,

894
39:59.090 --> 40:00.960
requesting the Central Army to send troops

895
40:00.960 --> 40:03.540
to Shanxi to help him suppress the Communists.

896
40:03.540 --> 40:04.620
That's great.

897
40:04.780 --> 40:06.420
We can take this opportunity

898
40:06.440 --> 40:07.890
to solve the Communist Army problem

899
40:07.890 --> 40:10.660
and also take the chance to solve the Shanxi problem.

900
40:10.660 --> 40:12.980
Cixiu is the one who knows me best.

901
40:15.220 --> 40:16.060
Do you know why

902
40:16.090 --> 40:17.730
I called you here this time?

903
40:18.470 --> 40:19.840
I want to appoint you as

904
40:20.210 --> 40:23.570
Commander-in-Chief of the First Route of the Taiyuan Pacification Office,

905
40:23.570 --> 40:24.920
leading troops into Shanxi.

906
40:24.920 --> 40:26.150
If I go to Shanxi,

907
40:26.180 --> 40:29.690
who will command the anti-communist operations in northwestern Guizhou?

908
40:29.690 --> 40:31.250
The overall situation in northwestern Guizhou is settled.

909
40:31.250 --> 40:32.360
Only the mopping up is left,

910
40:32.360 --> 40:34.490
which can be handed over to Gu Zhutong.

911
40:34.600 --> 40:35.260
Yes!

912
40:36.170 --> 40:37.130
Cixiu.

913
40:37.360 --> 40:39.360
A scholar must first have ambition,

914
40:39.660 --> 40:41.100
second have knowledge,

915
40:41.420 --> 40:42.900
and third have perseverance.

916
40:42.900 --> 40:43.600
In the world,

917
40:43.600 --> 40:45.110
nothing great and enduring

918
40:45.110 --> 40:46.920
comes without hardship!

919
40:47.970 --> 40:49.380
Well read!

920
40:50.600 --> 40:51.260
Let's go.

921
40:52.510 --> 40:55.510
On February 27, 1936,

922
40:56.070 --> 40:57.660
given that the Kuomintang army's

923
40:57.660 --> 41:00.110
encirclement of the 2nd and 6th Red Army Corps

924
41:00.110 --> 41:01.640
was becoming increasingly severe,

925
41:01.640 --> 41:03.420
the main forces of the 2nd and 6th Red Army Corps

926
41:03.420 --> 41:05.820
were forced to withdraw from Bijie County.

927
41:06.420 --> 41:07.230
First,

928
41:07.250 --> 41:10.310
they advanced west along the road between Bijie and Weining,

929
41:10.310 --> 41:13.440
and planned to pass through the Magu area east of Weining,

930
41:13.440 --> 41:17.240
heading south into the Panjiang area on the Yunnan-Guizhou border.

931
41:17.590 --> 41:18.720
At this time,

932
41:18.740 --> 41:20.730
six columns of the Kuomintang army,

933
41:20.730 --> 41:22.260
totaling over 100,000 men,

934
41:22.340 --> 41:24.310
immediately launched an encirclement and pursuit

935
41:24.310 --> 41:26.440
against the 2nd and 6th Red Army Corps,

936
41:26.450 --> 41:27.860
and preemptively

937
41:27.890 --> 41:30.170
arrived between Shuicheng and Weining,

938
41:30.340 --> 41:32.890
blocking the Red Army's path southward.

939
41:33.160 --> 41:34.360
On March 4th,

940
41:34.380 --> 41:35.770
the main forces of the two Corps

941
41:35.770 --> 41:38.970
were compressed into a narrow area in the Magu mountains,

942
41:39.430 --> 41:41.030
falling into a predicament.

943
41:41.700 --> 41:47.940
[Magu mountains, Bijie, Guizhou]

944
41:42.520 --> 41:44.330
Let the ruling classes

945
41:44.650 --> 41:46.770
tremble at a revolution.

946
41:47.080 --> 41:49.280
"The proletarians have nothing to lose

947
41:49.570 --> 41:51.340
but their chains.

948
41:52.460 --> 41:54.290
They have a world to win."

949
41:54.610 --> 41:57.420
What does these two sentences mean?

950
41:57.840 --> 41:58.590
They express

951
41:58.940 --> 42:01.170
Marx's belief

952
42:00.360 --> 42:02.270
[Zhou Suyuan, Commander of the Guizhou National Salvation Army to Resist Japan]

953
42:01.480 --> 42:02.690
in the proletarian revolution.

954
42:02.370 --> 42:03.470
[Rudolf Alfred Bosshardt, a British missionary]

955
42:03.140 --> 42:03.950
He believed

956
42:03.980 --> 42:06.780
that the proletarian revolution for liberation,

957
42:06.820 --> 42:08.950
including the army you and I are in now,

958
42:09.020 --> 42:10.060
will eventually win

959
42:09.910 --> 42:12.600
[Zhang Zhenhan, Tactics Instructor at the Red Army School; former Lieutenant General and Commander of the 42nd Division of the Kuomintang Army]

960
42:10.250 --> 42:12.130
true freedom and equality.

961
42:12.380 --> 42:14.650
The future world belongs to this army.

962
42:15.060 --> 42:16.080
Do you understand?

963
42:16.080 --> 42:16.810
Mr. Zhou,

964
42:17.070 --> 42:19.150
I think I understand what you said.

965
42:19.480 --> 42:21.960
You mean victory belongs to you,

966
42:22.330 --> 42:25.160
the great proletarian revolutionaries.

967
42:26.380 --> 42:27.840
For a foreign missionary,

968
42:27.980 --> 42:29.510
you are quite enlightened.

969
42:30.630 --> 42:32.920
This is God's grace.

970
42:33.220 --> 42:34.260
God?

971
42:35.850 --> 42:38.250
Who does God rely on to save the world?

972
42:38.440 --> 42:39.890
On you missionaries?

973
42:40.330 --> 42:43.190
How many missionaries are there in the whole world?

974
42:43.340 --> 42:45.400
Even if you add them all up in Guizhou,

975
42:45.410 --> 42:46.870
there are only a few dozen.

976
42:47.320 --> 42:48.640
Marx is different.

977
42:48.910 --> 42:50.310
He told the poor people

978
42:50.640 --> 42:52.600
to rise up and save themselves.

979
42:52.850 --> 42:55.330
How many poor people are there in the world?

980
42:55.670 --> 42:56.790
Out of ten people,

981
42:57.480 --> 42:59.290
at least nine are poor.

982
42:59.570 --> 43:01.120
Even I, a captured Kuomintang lieutenant general,

983
43:01.120 --> 43:01.790
quit,

984
43:01.950 --> 43:04.110
and came to the Red Army to save myself.
